# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit ab07e21 on excavador-turing/tpi, released as v1.5.0:
# `firmware install` re-resolves against a forced poll before refusing, so it
# no longer rejects the very command `firmware check` printed. The two read
# different caches with independent timing, and for up to half an hour after
# a release one could see it and the other could not.
#
# Measured 2026-09-09 with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container: `make
# tpi-source` reported got 656f88b6 against a zeroed expectation, then
# re-run to confirm it fetches and verifies cleanly.
sha256  656f88b6a10a32214b0b21876aebbb23fbc0482062973461650e59da45ad43a9  tpi-ab07e210bda4f9611cf784984692e2ea4299bb40-cargo2.tar.gz
